# vendor_persist_camera_prop is already declared by Lineage's common public
# policy (device/lineage/sepolicy/common/public/property.te) through
# system_vendor_config_prop(), and that file is part of the vendor, system_ext,
# public and recovery policy builds. Declaring the type here as well makes
# checkpolicy abort with:
#
#   ERROR 'Duplicate declaration of type' ... vendor_persist_camera_prop
#
# The label itself comes from device/qcom/sepolicy/generic/private/
# property_contexts and is referenced from both the system_ext and the vendor
# QCOM policy, which is what the common declaration covers.
